Error [E0003]: a `take_pattern` hole must be a bare name, optionally typed
  --> tests/ui/take_pattern_string_typed_bad_hole.jet:4:39
    |
  4 |     m :: c.take_pattern(String.{"inc-{id + 1} "}) ?? panic("no match")
    |                                       ^^
 Why: each `{hole}` binds a name (`{id}`) or a typed, fallibly-parsed name (`{id:Int}`) — the same grammar an `if == {}` pattern hole uses
 Fix: write `{name}` or `{name:Type}`
